{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お散歩したくなって1人で\nてくてくお花見をしてきました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のーんびりたくさん深呼吸して\nぶらぶらしたらリラックスできた♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/04/08/6191891/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ささっとスマホで撮ったけど\n案外綺麗に撮れてお気に入りです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにもおすそわけっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はどこか出店とかが\nあるようなとこに行きたかったけど\n来年におあずけ(ノω・、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日更新したので今日は短めで☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/04/08/6191891/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/04/08/6191891/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶちゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんが私の顔を\nぶちゅってするときは\n全力使ってぶちゅってして来ます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真のストックがだんだん\n無くなり始めてるので\n撮らなくちゃ～ヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は若と純奈が出演してる\n犬夜叉を観に行かせてもらいました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/04/08/6191891/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭のサイズ。笑\n今更か(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈とは撮り忘れてしまった(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に2人にも会えて嬉しかったし、\n何よりお芝居は迫力もあるし\n面白くて引き込まれました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉だけだとなかなか\n伝えきれませんが\n人を惹きつけるお芝居が出来るって\nすごいことだなぁと\n改めて思いました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若も純奈もキャストのみなさんが\n体調を崩さず千秋楽を迎えられることを\n陰ながら祈ってます∩^ω^∩♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張で個別握手会！\n17thは個握1回目ですね～ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何着よっかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん今晩は\n「明日まなったんと\nどんな話しよっかなぁ」\nって考えながら寝てくだちゃい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約束だよー(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/04/08/6191891/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷくっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、来週の土曜日の\nバナナ♪ゼロミュージックに\n出演しますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた1人で\nお邪魔しちゃいました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で～！\nお風呂はいってこよ∩^ω^∩"}],"source":"archive"}